page 514 19830
block html 0 0 400 19830
  block body 8 8 384 19806
    block h1 8 8 384 40
      line 8 8 384 40 base 28
        text "General Computer Textfiles" 8 12 344 32 serif 32 bold
    block p 8 69 384 180
      line 8 69 384 20 base 14
        text "Your one-stop shop for all files of a \"computery\" nature," 8 71 364 16 serif 16
      line 8 89 384 20 base 14
        text "that cover how to rebuild a piece of computer hardware to" 8 91 372 16 serif 16
      line 8 109 384 20 base 14
        text "do something it was never meant to do, or to see someone" 8 111 380 16 serif 16
      line 8 129 384 20 base 14
        text "go really deeply into a computing subject that would cause" 8 131 384 16 serif 16
      line 8 149 384 20 base 14
        text "most people to yawn and look for the snack table. Since" 8 151 364 16 serif 16
      line 8 169 384 20 base 14
        text "BBSes were on computers, it was natural for people who" 8 171 364 16 serif 16
      line 8 189 384 20 base 14
        text "used BBSes to focus on all aspects of these wonderful" 8 191 352 16 serif 16
      line 8 209 384 20 base 14
        text "machines. The evidence of their interest and their" 8 211 320 16 serif 16
      line 8 229 384 20 base 14
        text "experimentation resides below." 8 231 204 16 serif 16
    block p 8 265 384 120
      line 8 265 384 20 base 14
        text "Of course, nearly ALL textfiles are computer-related in" 8 267 348 16 serif 16
      line 8 285 384 20 base 14
        text "some fashion, and some subjects might fit here but fit even" 8 287 384 16 serif 16
      line 8 305 384 20 base 14
        text "better in another section. For example, you should most" 8 307 360 16 serif 16
      line 8 325 384 20 base 14
        span a 164 327 84 16 link 0
        span a 280 327 36 16 link 1
        text "definitely check out the " 8 327 156 16 serif 16
        text "programming" 164 327 84 16 serif 16 underline link 0
        text " and " 248 327 32 16 serif 16
        text "apple" 280 327 36 16 serif 16 underline link 1
        text " sections" 316 327 60 16 serif 16
      line 8 345 384 20 base 14
        text "as well, as you might not agree with what I decided" 8 347 340 16 serif 16
      line 8 365 384 20 base 14
        text "should go where." 8 367 112 16 serif 16
